                        "sense_id": "5464f73f-041d-35ab-89a1-c4f2e043ec50",
                        "entry_id": "6a85bc29-1671-3a92-a2fd-06f0f76e8f0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A yob."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Commonwealth",
                            "Ireland",
                            "UK",
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8a84a52-b665-4d54-b74f-9aacc07ed26e",
                                "sense_id": "5464f73f-041d-35ab-89a1-c4f2e043ec50",
                                "text": "Yeah, but you heard what Blake said. We wouldn't stand a chance against Pike's mob. They're a right bunch of yobbos."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ab28834-6901-46c9-93c9-73da9a6d7e59",
                                "sense_id": "5464f73f-041d-35ab-89a1-c4f2e043ec50",
                                "text": "He stared at them with eyes dull with fatigue, and let out a long sigh. “Trouble, trouble” he replied wearily. “Skinheads and yobboes fighting the coloureds\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e409a2b6-4383-4901-a2c4-a8f596f3da7c",
                                "sense_id": "5464f73f-041d-35ab-89a1-c4f2e043ec50",
                                "text": "We're not catering to the yobbos. We'd rather have a smaller crowd of nice people that are really into the game than a whole mass of uncouth people"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5a6d36b-2f19-4b6d-944d-d15188387c80",
                                "sense_id": "5464f73f-041d-35ab-89a1-c4f2e043ec50",
                                "text": "A wanker fights inequality / And for people’s rights / A wanker fights class prejudice / A yobbo just fights"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
